orded start_event. Original acquisition uses verified download completion; an explicitly requested rerun on already verified data has its own fixed campaign start. Every later preparation step, calibration, agent call, failure, training/control and scoring job counts.\",\n    \"no_test_feedback\": true,\n    \"knowledge_revision\": \"knowledge-access-v3\",\n    \"knowledge_review\": {\n      \"policy\": \"Evaluate relevant external references against local evidence; adoption is optional. Missing source detail and negative transfer remain explicit.\",\n      \"proposal_output\": \"Add top-level knowledge_assessments: [{knowledge_id, decision: used|considered|rejected|unresolved, rationale, transformed_mechanism, variant_names, nearest_work_difference, falsifier}]. Cover retrieved industry cards; identify the concrete changed mechanism for used cards. This is provenance, not causal proof.\",\n      \"reflection\": \"Review the latest knowledge-usage.json alongside outcomes; distinguish declared use, executed changes, mechanism evidence and unresolved attribution.\"\n    },\n    \"latest_knowledge_usage\": null,\n    \"selection_policy\": {\n      \"id\": \"taobao-four-task-macro-auc-v1\",\n      \"split\": \"validation\",\n      \"tasks\": [\n        \"is_click\",\n        \"cart\",\n        \"fav\",\n        \"buy\"\n      ],\n      \"weights\": {\n        \"is_click\": 0.25,\n        \"cart\": 0.25,\n        \"fav\": 0.25,\n        \"buy\": 0.25\n      },\n      \"primary\": \"macro_auc\",\n      \"direction\": \"maximize\",\n      \"tie_breakers\": [\n        \"macro_logloss ascending\",\n        \"parameters ascending\",\n        \"trial_id ascending\"\n      ],\n      \"missing_task\": \"invalid; never average only the available tasks\",\n      \"regression_policy\": \"Report each task's AUC and Logloss change against the reference and entry model; explain trade-offs in topic decisions. No undeclared per-task veto threshold.\",\n      \"test_policy\": \"Selection